The public OpenSSL fixtures are copied from the reference's
 test/pq-mldsa44/fixtures.json; its GPLv3 text is tests/data/TOS-LICENSE.txt.

RTOS acknowledges the National Institute of Standards and Technology as the
source of the ACVP vectors (ACVP-Server commit
975de31eb83d87039ec88934fdc47d8c312b892d). On 2026-10-10, RTOS extracted the
